DEMO   MADEUP   CONFIG (1.0)
  ROOTCAT  S.
  FILES .
  LEXENTRIES   (DEMO MADEUP).
  TEMPLATES (DEMO MADEUP). 
  RULES   (DEMO MADEUP).
  GOVERNABLERELATIONS    SUBJ OBJ OBJ2 COMP XCOMP OBL OBL-?+.
  SEMANTICFUNCTIONS    ADJUNCT  TOPIC FOCUS POSS STANDARD.
  NONDISTRIBUTIVES    NUM PERS CONJ-FORM.
  EPSILON   e.
  OPTIMALITYORDER NOGOOD PPadj +PPattach.
  GENOPTIMALITYORDER GenBadPunct NOGOOD +PUNCT CAPITAL.


----


DEMO MADEUP RULES (1.0)

S --> { NP: @GF
      | PP: @GF
      }*
      V: ^=!.

NP --> N: ^=!.

PP --> P
       NP: (^ OBJ) = !.


----


DEMO MADEUP TEMPLATES (1.0)

GF = {(^ SUBJ) = ! | (^ OBJ) = ! | (^ OBJ2) = ! | (^ OBL) = ! | (^ ADJUNCT) = ! }.

INTRANS(P) = (^ PRED)='P<(^ SUBJ)>'.

PASS(FRAME) = { FRAME 
		(^ PASSIVE) = -
		| FRAME
		(^ PASSIVE) = +
		(^ PARTICIPLE) =c past
		(^ OBJ)-->(^ SUBJ)
		{ (^ SUBJ)-->(^ OBL-AG)
		| (^ SUBJ)--> NULL}
		}.

DAT-SHIFT(FRAME) = { FRAME
                     | FRAME
                       (^ OBJ)-->(^ OBJ2)
                       (^ OBL-TO)-->(^ OBJ)}.

TRANS(P) = @(PASS (^ PRED)='P<(^ SUBJ)(^ OBJ)>').

OPT-TRANS(P) = { @(INTRANS P) | @(TRANS P) }.

DITRANS(P) = @(PASS @(DAT-SHIFT (^ PRED)='P<(^ SUBJ) (^ OBJ)
              (^ OBL-TO)>')).


----


DEMO MADEUP LEXICON (1.0)


"NOUNS"

tam    N * (^ PRED) = 'garden'.
plim   N * (^ PRED) = 'gorilla'.
tipf   N * (^ PRED) = 'banana'.
bobo   N * (^ PRED) = 'baboon'.



"VERBS"

taotao V * @(OPT-TRANS eat).
guagua V * @(DITRANS give).



"PREPOSITION"

ya     P * (^ PRED) = 'in<(^ OBJ)>'.
di     P * (^ PRED) = 'to<(^ OBJ)>'.


